{
  "id": "6a965cdcb829300062375c3a",
  "title": "裸の王様",
  "created": 1788239076,
  "updated": 1788239077,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a965cdcb829300062375c3a",
      "text": "裸の王様",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239076,
      "updated": 1788239076
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce30000000000807118",
      "text": "[AI.icon]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239076,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce40000000000807119",
      "text": " もとの意味：",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce4000000000080711a",
      "text": "  [アンデルセン]の[童話]が由来です。バカな人には見えない服を着た王様が、実は[裸]のまま[パレード]をします。",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce4000000000080711b",
      "text": " まわりの心理：",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce4000000000080711c",
      "text": "  家来も町の人も、自分がバカだと思われたくないので「立派な服だ」とうそをつきます。",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce4000000000080711d",
      "text": " 真実を言う子供：",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce4000000000080711e",
      "text": "  最後に小さな子供だけが「王様は裸だ」と素直に叫びます。",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce4000000000080711f",
      "text": " 教訓：",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce40000000000807120",
      "text": " \t権力者に[本当のことが言えない空気]や、[見栄]を張る人間の弱さを[風刺]したお話です。",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce40000000000807121",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a965ce40000000000807122",
      "text": "[井戸端王]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1788239077,
      "updated": 1788239077
    }
  ]
}